[quest house_collects active] ~ quest house_collects done_struck done
The hall is very quiet. Two of his men are helping Cingetos up off the floor, and he lets them, which is the worst part. Everyone is watching Dannotalos, and he knows exactly what they're seeing.

[!flag dan_forfeit_silver] He calls for wax and writes without hurrying, and seals it with his horse, and holds it out. "To the house of Vettius at Cabillonum: Brigodunon of the Cadurci is released from my account, and I will not take delivery. The forfeit." His voice is perfectly even. "And the joint is yours."
[flag dan_forfeit_silver] He sends a boy for a bag, and weighs it in his hand, and tosses it to you. "Not as much as you weigh," he says. "As much as you're worth." His voice is perfectly even. "And the joint is yours."

You eat it, because you have to. By the time you've finished, three of the men who were sitting nearest him have found reasons to go home early.
-> hub

=== duel_lost
~ set dan_duel_done; honor -3
Cingetos is back at his place with the joint in his hands, and somebody has thrown water on you, and the hall has gone back to its dinner as if you'd never stood up.

"An old custom," Dannotalos says, "and a good one. It settles things." He doesn't look at you. "You've eaten my meat and lost my floor. Bibracte will be talking about it by morning. Was there anything else?"
-> hub

=== roll
~ set dan_roll_tried
He goes still. Not for long, but you see it.

"Someone at Noviodunum has a good hand and a long memory." He turns his cup round once. "The council of all Gaul meets on this hill after the harvest. If they learned that an Aeduan bought the hostages of Gaul forward from Rome, they'd want a great deal explained." He looks at you. "What do you want for it?"
* [speech 45] "Strike Brigodunon off your account, in your hand, under your seal. Then this stays a roll." -> roll_struck
* [PRE 7] Say nothing at all. Just keep looking at him. -> roll_struck
* "Strike Brigodunon off, and the roll is yours." -> roll_sold
* "I'll think about it." -> hub

=== roll_struck
~ set dan_enemy; xp 100
[!quest partner done] ~ quest partner struck
[!quest brig_line done] ~ quest brig_line done_released done; set house_left; clear epo_at_brig
[quest house_collects active] ~ quest house_collects done_struck done
He calls for wax and writes it while you watch: "Dannotalos of the Aedui, to the house of Vettius at Cabillonum: Brigodunon of the Cadurci is released from my account. I will not take delivery." He presses his horse into the seal, and gives it to his steward to send to the Arar tonight.

"Keep your roll," he says. "Bring it to the council, if you like. You'll find a council is a great many men with debts." He doesn't smile. "I won't forget you, Brigodunon."
-> hub

=== roll_sold
~ take hostage_roll; set roll_sold; xp 50
[!quest partner done] ~ quest partner struck
[!quest brig_line done] ~ quest brig_line done_released done; set house_left; clear epo_at_brig
