He writes the release, and seals it, and sends it to the Arar tonight. Then he reads the roll, all of it, by the fire, slowly, the way he read the faces round the table, and puts it inside his tunic.

"A list of who has sold whom," he says. "That's worth more than gold, in the right winter. Thank you."
-> hub

=== iron
~ set dan_iron_tried; set dan_enemy; xp 100
